#: scenario8:scenario8_1E71D58A_55DC_44D1_93BE_5C4E4AE92DAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 898d368466bdd39ebbe51aa2976e60e301854e4a772677ce321e808f42d76ba3
