msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Morgana’s death is in three days...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We have until then to get all three "
"keys..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……모르가나가 죽는 건 사흘 후…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그 전까지 ⟪k:5⟫열쇠 세 개를 얻겠습니다……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6549EA6F_B9B1_4040_9379_5CDAA3BE5A72
