msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It won’t be easy.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I mean, we weren’t even present in this world until "
"today..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫꽤…… ⟪k:3⟫힘들어 보이네요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫우리는 갑자기 나타난 인간에 불과하니까요……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4293848C_4AD9_4E87_A2C6_4663BFA0DF86
